# Run evidence and the manifest are generated. They ARE retained evidence
# (C10), but they are not committed: the manifest maps run_id to version, and
# keeping it beside the blinded bundles would undo the blinding the human
# evaluation depends on. One bundle is committed as a worked example under
# records/W04/. records/ itself is never ignored.
evidence/*/
data/run_manifest.jsonl